Gender: Male.
Species: Human (formerly); Great Old One.
Age: Hundreds of thousands of subjective years.
Status: Alive, fully awakened.
Origin: Transmigrator.
Residence: Sefirah Castle.
Affiliation: Tarot Club, Evernight Goddess. 
Occupation: Founder and leader of the Tarot Club; Protector of Earth.
Era: Fifth Epoch.
Current Year: 1358 of the Fifth Epoch.
Original Pathway: Fool.
Former Sequence: Sequence 0: Fool.
Current Level: Above the Sequence.
